  <div class="hw-step__body">
    <h2>Where the data comes from</h2>
    <p>Everything starts with the <strong>TMDB movie dataset v11</strong> on Kaggle. 1.4 million movies, 24 columns per row. I only use 12 of them: plot, keywords, genres, tagline, title, year, language, country, studios, runtime, rating, and original title. The rest are collaborative signals like vote counts and popularity scores. Including those actually made the embeddings worse, so they got cut.</p>
